<title>USA: TABLE - O.I. Corp Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - O.I. Corp Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>COLLEGE STATION, Texas 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.09		    $0.05</p>
<p> Net			    364			224</p>
<p> Revs			 5,735		    5,094</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,990		    4,138</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			    686			438</p>
<p> Revs			11,056		    9,742</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,032		    4,133</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for O.I. Corp second quarter of 1997 included $31,000 in costs for a patent infringement claim.</p>
<p>Net income for the second quarter of 1996 included $365,000 in costs for a patent infringement claim which were partially offset by a $165,000 legal expense reserve established at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>For the first six months of 1997 costs for the patent infringement claim were $49,000, as compared to $789,000 in 1996.</p>
